      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `6f165a843a9d35a7051aad095b2614a3c84bcb4e5f801c02f3874e2167ce5374--45100do002_2008.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2008\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 9 of 9\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 2ff5906d4dc489cb363391afdd4f9bdbcb06752d5e7b38083b4ce2730959ec10 | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | d26828d36d4bda409c7dc9665a4a899c9f3de6442adff5c40a678c020a010ed1 | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | ed9899e4982e325e1e4d562e86f4c3fae661e00c8323e2acbd7ca3844781c95d | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | 2a928b4e63da9685fae6fe89b921831b816dd3c951f33ed73166317a411e2c2e | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | e86e2fd1ad79718e21ab456c93499bdbf1f33e7a16d7687d2b565e6665f60605 | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | e7e233dbb7f733b6409ce1bcff1e12edf8087185b37113f3972bbed5d0e110d7 | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | 331e0dfedc7865aa304011326cb04303e89247a1b15754fb1cf48bd17ca9fcf0 | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | 1315427ac1f715afa8cf881698dd650f29409defce9c0cc63ef12cf68efcec4e | missing |\n| \"Table_8\" | ea19cd262e8ad9a7d201718fe69c8b434dfbf6c9bf68ff0fcda1fb1c2c74106b | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
